5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to understand the true financial scope before we commit. What does the ledger actually show for this year’s allocation?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Jonathan, checking the ledger is standard. But I’m curious why we’re ignoring the readmission figures from the call-back trial.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shion. Readmission data is vital for patient safety. I’m also worried about how new duties will affect our already stretched nursing teams.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the physical space. Can we even fit new equipment in the rooms without blocking the approach roads?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about sustainability. Programs often fail in year two when support fades. Let’s ensure the foundation is solid before we build.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the focus on safety and space. However, without knowing the actual funds available, we risk proposing programs we simply cannot afford to maintain.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
